From: clsx524 <clsx524@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:46:30 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] boot: add the boot-state verifier

Move slot detection into a boot-state helper that verifies the running kernel against the boot partitions, install it in both kernel packages, and check it in the rootfs verifier. Resolve the kernel license and external component trees from the superproject root.
---
